[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    100[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `translation/src/lib.rs` deliberately calls the libc `printf` (rather than
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    101[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `std::io::stdout`) so the bytes land in the *same libc `stdout` FILE stream and
